{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/4474ec1633d419e6aa73b6a31ff6b153.poster.avif?t=1771549992\" width=640 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/4474ec1633d419e6aa73b6a31ff6b153.webm?t=1771549992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/4474ec1633d419e6aa73b6a31ff6b153.mp4?t=1771549992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One winter night, you find a hunter in the woods: A man so warm and charming you feel as if you've known him all your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But appearances can be deceiving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You'd know that well, <strong>wouldn't you?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/7b30c441927077a9fa006f69c96a3784.poster.avif?t=1771549992\" width=640 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/7b30c441927077a9fa006f69c96a3784.webm?t=1771549992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/d8a92047b14f32dcad62e6d7069c3a4d.poster.avif?t=1771549992\" width=640 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/d8a92047b14f32dcad62e6d7069c3a4d.webm?t=1771549992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/d8a92047b14f32dcad62e6d7069c3a4d.mp4?t=1771549992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Snow White Ashes</i> is a <strong>dark fairy tale romance</strong> where hunter meets hunter\u2013and beauty is only <strong>skin</strong> deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>rich, captivating story</strong> inspired by fairy tales and myths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices</strong> that influence both the narrative and your relationship with your hunter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings:</strong> Good, bad and everything in-between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand drawn artwork and CGs.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>original piano-based soundtrack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One charming, <strong><i>not at all bloodthirsty love interest.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You, a <i>perfectly innocent, guileless</i> heroine </strong>with no hidden motives whatsoever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: This game contains darker themes, especially around toxic/unhealthy relationships. Please visit my website if you need a detailed content warning breakdown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/4d90fb0186bd6652833bdb90755b4c5c.avif?t=1771549992\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Snow White Ashes</i> is a solo project, with the art, music, story and programming created by ENDYSIS (me!) Thanks so much for checking out my game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thank you: Calamanser, Thea, cobaye, Sammy L.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/281ad5faa5848d5e323e9b300197d2f0.poster.avif?t=1771549992\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/281ad5faa5848d5e323e9b300197d2f0.webm?t=1771549992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/extras/281ad5faa5848d5e323e9b300197d2f0.mp4?t=1771549992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2811620?t=1771549992","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771549992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771549992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771549992","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"de